This distribution includes an independent-head optimization implementation and
a fixed snapshot of MeisenMeister under third_party/meisenmeister.

MeisenMeister authors: Benjamin Hamm, Yannick Kirchhoff, Maximilian Rokuss,
and Klaus Maier-Hein. Upstream: https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/MeisenMeister
Snapshot: a9b8ded20d59a7f6df8b03f24a6ec28d9d8ede0e
The upstream Apache-2.0 LICENSE is retained without modification.

Portable release changes: extract final active head classes, portable paths,
variable cohort validation, separate baseline/evaluation CLI, safe loading of
toolkit-produced checkpoints, and tests. See provenance.json.

The source-code license does not grant rights to datasets or model weights.
MeisenMeister published weights have a separate CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license.
No datasets, subject-level predictions, or pretrained weights are distributed.
